    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Passed postcombat main without playing a land when Wasteland was available to destroy the opponent's only land (Bloodstained Mire), which would cut them off mana entirely while facing lethal next turn from Reality Smasher + Thought-Knot Seer. Even accounting for losing City of Traitors to its sacrifice trigger, denying the opponent all mana sources when they're at 10 life facing 9 damage next combat is extremely strong.",
