    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "GPT5n ESPN timed out and took no action during their precombat main phase, wasting their entire turn. They had a Mountain to play and Bloodstained Mire to crack, which would give them 2 mana to start deploying their hand of goblins (Skirk Prospector, Goblin Lackey, etc.). With Reality Smasher (5/5) and Thought-Knot Seer (4/4) threatening lethal in two attack steps against their 10 life, every turn of development is critical.",
